
### 1. Get All Machines
GET http://localhost:3000/machines


### 2. Get Machine By ID
GET http://localhost:3000/machines/1


### 3. Add Machine
# @name addMachine
POST http://localhost:3000/machines
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Machine 4",
    "product": "Masala Tea"
}


### 4. Update Machine
@machineId = {{addMachine.response.body.$.id}}

PUT http://localhost:3000/machines/{{machineId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Machine 4 Updated",
    "product": "Ginger Tea"
}


### 5. Delete Machine
DELETE http://localhost:3000/machines/{{machineId}}


### 6. Search Machines By Product
GET http://localhost:3000/machines?product=Tea


### 7. Get All Operators
GET http://localhost:3000/operators


### 8. Get Operator By ID
GET http://localhost:3000/operators/1


### 9. Get Assignments With Names
GET http://localhost:3000/assignments


### 10. Get Latest Audit Records
GET http://localhost:3000/audit
